Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.08,0:00:03.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay, so let's talk about the session. 好的，那我们来谈谈这个环节。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.02,0:00:11.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's my great pleasure to introduce Dr. Jim Fan, who is the director of robotics and the distinguished scientist at NVIDIA. 很荣幸向大家介绍英伟达机器人部门总监、杰出科学家范麟熙博士。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.28,0:00:11.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Take it away. 请开始吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.90,0:00:12.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you. 谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.89,0:00:26.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,About two months ago was happy Thursday, September the 3rd. 大约两个月前，是令人开心的星期四，9月3日。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.33,0:00:31.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The robots were partying, GPUs were spinning, life as a roboticist was good. 机器人在狂欢，GPU在运转，作为机器人研究者的生活很美好。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.19,0:00:34.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that's the day Astra dropped. 那一天，Astra发布了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.17,0:00:40.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have never seen a paper in human history that shattered so many dreams. 我从未见过任何一篇论文，能如此彻底地击碎那么多梦想。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.66,0:00:42.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I made it. 是的，我做到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.06,0:00:44.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can hear the sound of your hearts breaking. 我能听到你们心碎的声音。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.17,0:00:49.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then we did what any respectable scientific community would do. 然后，我们像任何有尊严的科学共同体一样做了事。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.45,0:00:51.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,We went through five stages of grief. 我们经历了五个悲伤阶段。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.26,0:00:53.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Denial. 否认。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.38,0:00:55.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is fake news. 这是假新闻。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:56.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,These are cherry-picked. 这些都是挑出来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.00,0:00:57.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Anger. 愤怒。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.72,0:01:00.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,How dare they call themselves roboticists now? 他们居然还敢自称机器人专家？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.88,0:01:01.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bargaining. 讨价还价。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.44,0:01:03.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,They still need my motion planner, right? 他们还是需要我的运动规划器，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.66,0:01:04.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right? 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:08.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Depression with a wine bottle, my PhD is now a joke in the system prompt. 抑郁，手里拿着一瓶酒，我的博士论文现在成了系统提示里的笑话。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.44,0:01:12.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,And finally, acceptance, yeah, it's all over. 最后，接受了，是的，一切都结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.94,0:01:18.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or as a friend summarized with dead eyes, winter is coming. 或者像一位朋友用无神的眼睛总结的那样：寒冬将至。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.23,0:01:27.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yet when we think that Astra is going to rule us all, this guy Diogo, he came along with Jeff, a new System 1 model. 然而当我们以为Astra将统治一切时，迪戈出现了，和杰夫一起带来了新的System 1模型。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.79,0:01:31.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's fast, reactive, and suddenly everyone's excited again. 它快速、响应灵敏，突然间所有人都再次兴奋起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.28,0:01:38.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,So I argue that you can't possibly be excited about a System 1 for language models and hold a funeral for robotics, 所以我认为，你不可能对语言模型的系统1感到兴奋，同时又为机器人技术的消亡举行葬礼。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.92,0:01:43.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,which needs to be faster, more reactive, and more local. 机器人技术需要更快、更灵敏、更本地化。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.87,0:01:48.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,So is System 1 still needed is the wrong question to begin with. 因此，系统1是否仍然必要，这个问题从一开始就错了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.47,0:01:53.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because everything is going to be a skill, including System 1. 因为一切都会变成一种技能，包括系统1。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.92,0:01:56.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,The right question is, what makes a good skill? 正确的问题是，什么样的技能才算好？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.98,0:02:02.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Can you easily teach it by showing? can we easily steer it by reasoning? 你能通过演示轻松教会它吗？我们能否通过推理轻松引导它？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.83,0:02:05.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that's how we think about GR00T 2. 这正是我们思考 GR00T 2 的方式。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.89,0:02:09.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,From a full stack perspective, adaptable and steerable. 从全栈角度看，它具备可适应性和可引导性。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.12,0:02:20.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,On a core model side of GR00T, it is a two billion parameter world action model that takes as input language, multi view, camera and state. 在 GR00T 的核心模型层面，它是一个拥有二十亿参数的世界动作模型，输入包括语言、多视角摄像头和状态信息。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.24,0:02:24.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,And here, what you see, not a single pixel is real. 这里你看到的，没有一个像素是真实的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.20,0:02:27.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're watching the robot dreaming. 你正在观看机器人在做梦。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.72,0:02:33.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's predicting the next few frames in the pixel space, and then acting upon that dream. 它在像素空间中预测接下来的几帧画面，然后据此采取行动。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.22,0:02:40.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the model jointly decodes the action along with the predicted future frames in one diffusion pass. 该模型在一次扩散过程中联合解码动作和预测的未来画面。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.32,0:02:46.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,We also designed GR00T 2 Turbo, optimized for efficient edge compute. 我们还设计了专为高效边缘计算优化的 GR00T 2 Turbo。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:54.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,It uses four times fewer spatial video tokens, so it runs much faster while keeping the same two billion parameters. 它使用的空间视频词元数量仅为原来的四分之一，因此运行速度更快，同时保持了相同的二十亿参数。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.69,0:03:02.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we trained GR00T 2 on a huge corpus of well-annotated multi-view data that can be retargeted to the robot. 我们使用大量标注良好的多视角数据集对 GR00T 2 进行了训练，这些数据可被重新用于机器人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.22,0:03:06.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,So let's see GR00T 2 in action. 那么，让我们看看 GR00T 2 的实际表现。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.28,0:03:11.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the first clip, fully autonomous, no speed up and cut. 这是第一段视频，完全自主，无加速也无剪辑。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.70,0:03:18.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,The robot carefully takes the memory stick out of GB300 and replaces it. 机器人小心翼翼地将内存条从 GB300 中取出并更换。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.62,0:03:22.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,So basically GR00T is maintaining the data center that is used to train GR00T. 本质上，GR00T 正在维护用于训练 GR00T 的数据中心。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.33,0:03:28.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I hear that these days it's called recursive self-improvement, RSI. 我听说现在这被称为递归自我改进，简称 RSI。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.77,0:03:31.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe this is the first spark of physical RSI. 或许这正是物理 RSI 的首个火花。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.49,0:03:36.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,And here's a UPS store scenario. 这是一个 UPS 门店场景。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.28,0:03:40.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,This demo is fine-tuned with only one hour of demonstration. 这个演示仅用一小时的示范数据进行了微调。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.82,0:03:46.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,The robot picks up the scissors, it carefully wraps it around the fingers and it cuts the labels. 机器人拿起剪刀，小心地将其绕在手指上，然后剪下标签。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.40,0:03:55.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,So some parts here, I have to speed up to fit the talk but I will keep the interesting bits at 1X real time. 所以这里有些部分我需要加快速度以适应演讲时间，但我将保持有趣的内容以1倍速实时播放。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:04:03.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, you can see it here, carefully peeling that label, this real time autonomous, 你看，它正在仔细剥离标签，这是实时的自主操作，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.32,0:04:10.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,and then it will apply that label on the NVIDIA package, and it's gonna scan it. 然后它会将标签贴在英伟达的包装上，并进行扫描。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.21,0:04:15.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you can see that indicator whenever I speed up on the lower left corner. 你可以在左下角看到指示器，每当我在加快速度时它就会亮起。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.01,0:04:22.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,And here we take a page out of the high school chemistry lab, so this is crude salt filtering. 这里我们借鉴了高中化学实验室的做法，这是粗盐过滤实验。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.06,0:04:32.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Basically the robot will scoop some salt into the beaker and it will start to dissolve it, and then it's gonna place that beaker onto that machine. 机器人基本上会舀一些盐放进烧杯，开始溶解，然后将烧杯放到那台机器上。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.26,0:04:38.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,So I have to speed this up because in GR00T 2, we're going all in on long horizon, 我必须加快这部分，因为在 GR00T 2 中，我们全力投入长程任务，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.80,0:04:44.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,that's what manipulation, that pushes routinely beyond three minutes and even five minutes. 这类操作通常持续超过三分钟，甚至达到五分钟。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.38,0:04:51.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,That consists of 20 more steps, and every step has cascading error, so end-to-end is very difficult without a good model. 这包含了20个额外步骤，每个步骤都存在级联误差，因此没有一个良好的模型，端到端实现非常困难。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.86,0:04:59.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,And here is my favorite part, we teach the robot to clean up after itself, so we can spend less time resetting the scene. 这里是我最喜欢的部分，我们教机器人自己清理现场，这样我们就能节省更多时间来重置场景。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.11,0:05:10.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,And compared to baseline techniques, GR00T 2 and Turbo push the frontier into double digit gains over the prior state of the art. 与基线技术相比，GR00T 2 和 Turbo 将性能提升推向了超越以往技术水平的两位数增长。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.64,0:05:19.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,A good System 1 skill must be easy to teach, so we introduce an emergent feature called X-Adapt. 一种优秀的 System 1 技能必须易于教授，因此我们引入了一种涌现能力，称为 X-Adapt。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.64,0:05:21.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the idea is very simple. 核心理念非常简单。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.42,0:05:30.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,You collect data in an easy domain, like human wearables or simulation, and then you transfer those skills zero-shot onto the real robot. 你在人类可穿戴设备或仿真等简单领域收集数据，然后将这些技能零样本迁移到真实机器人上。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.96,0:05:32.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,And let me give you some examples. 让我举几个例子。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.02,0:05:38.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a human wearing UMI grippers and collect the data on a long horizon assembly task. 这是一个人佩戴着 UMI 夹具，完成长程装配任务的数据采集。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.27,0:05:44.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then we fine tune GR00T 2 checkpoint on only the data from humans and zero 然后我们仅用人类数据对 GR00T 2 的检查点进行微调。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.11,0:05:48.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,shot transfer it to these yam grippers that actually look quite different from the UMI grippers. 将这个动作传输到这些夹爪上，它们实际上看起来与UMI夹爪差别很大。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.47,0:05:53.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the robot is able to complete this assembly task from end to end. 机器人能够从头到尾完成这项装配任务。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.12,0:05:55.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this one is even harder. 而且这个更难。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.18,0:05:58.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,We captured the data in human mocap gloves. 我们通过人体动捕手套采集了数据。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.74,0:06:06.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,So the part that you saw from crude salt filtering where the robot carefully places the filter and then it wets it 你看到的那段粗盐过滤过程，是机器人小心翼翼地放置滤纸，然后将其浸湿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.36,0:06:16.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,and pour the salt water through that part can be entirely zero-shot adapted from the human mocap data with zero teleop. 将盐水倒入该部分，可完全通过零样本方式从人类动捕数据中适配，无需遥操作。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.42,0:06:21.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,And with these devices, we can do these highly dynamic motions like tossing. 借助这些设备，我们可以完成抛掷等高度动态的动作。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.80,0:06:23.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's very hard to teleop. 这非常难以通过遥操作实现。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.60,0:06:27.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you can mix and match different types of robots on our warehouse line. 你可以在我们的仓库产线上随意搭配不同类型的机器人。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.41,0:06:31.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,And at our lab, we just have so many random stuff to throw. 在我们实验室里，堆满了各种乱七八糟的东西可以扔。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.13,0:06:33.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,So it's fun to see them just throwing stuff all day. 看它们整天扔东西，非常有趣。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.42,0:06:44.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,And to push X-Adapt even further, we designed these exoskeleton devices called DexUMI that has a one-to-one mechanical mapping to robot hands. 为了进一步推进 X-Adapt，我们设计了名为 DexUMI 的外骨骼设备，其机械结构与机器人手具有一对一映射关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.66,0:06:51.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we use those exoskeleton to collect the data and we fine-tune GR00T only on that data. 我们使用这些外骨骼采集数据，并仅用该数据对 GR00T 进行微调。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.20,0:06:54.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this is fully autonomous. 因此这是完全自主的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.20,0:06:58.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,And yes, we do trust the robot with the knife. 是的，我们确实信任机器人使用刀具。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.31,0:07:08.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,And actually, after these experiments, our whole lab now smells like banana, because it's more than what we can humanly consume. 实际上，经过这些实验后，我们整个实验室现在都弥漫着香蕉味，因为产生的香蕉量远超人类能消耗的。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.69,0:07:14.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,So here the exoskeleton and the robot hand actually look very different from the video. 因此，视频中外骨骼和机器人手的外观实际上看起来与视频中大不相同。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.20,0:07:20.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,So WAM's video pre-training helps bridge this visual gap zero-shot. 因此，WAM 的视频预训练有助于弥合这一视觉差距，实现零样本迁移。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.98,0:07:22.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,And here comes my favorite. 然后就到了我最喜欢的环节。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.60,0:07:24.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,You see how natural this twisting motion is? 你看这个扭转动作多么自然吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.14,0:07:27.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can't get that subtlety through teleop. 这种细微差别是遥操作无法实现的。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.86,0:07:32.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because the mechanics of DexUMI is closely matched with the hand, 因为 DexUMI 的机械结构与人手高度匹配，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.89,0:07:38.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,we're able to capture these fine details of human dexterity directly onto the robot. 我们能够将人类灵巧性的细微特征直接捕捉并映射到机器人上。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.98,0:07:43.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then simulation is another very easy source of data. 然后，仿真也是数据的另一个非常容易获取的来源。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.20,0:07:47.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,So we can train reinforcement learning in simulation, Isaac Lab, 我们可以在仿真环境中训练强化学习，使用 Isaac Lab，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.92,0:07:56.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,and then we can generate synthetic data through domain randomization, and we fine-tune GR00T only on the same trajectories. 然后通过域随机化生成合成数据，并仅在相同轨迹上对 GR00T 进行微调。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.26,0:07:59.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,and with zero-shot X-Adapted into the real. 并通过零样本 X-Adapt 实现真实场景的部署。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.50,0:08:03.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this part is real autonomous 1X, directly from the sim. 因此这一部分是真正的自主 1X，直接从仿真中生成。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:08.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this also applies to whole body local manipulation. 这同样适用于全身局部操作。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.72,0:08:14.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,This part is same in Isaac Lab, and this is zero-shot transferring to real at our kitchen. 这部分在 Isaac Lab 中是一样的，这是我们把零样本迁移应用到厨房真实场景中的例子。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.94,0:08:23.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,And with X-Adapt, GR00T 2 Turbo paired with Sonic, the whole body controller that we introduced last year. 在 X-Adapt 的加持下，GR00T 2 Turbo 与我们去年推出的全身控制器 Sonic 配合工作。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.94,0:08:30.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,So here are our researchers drop coffee a lot at 2 a.m. when the human brains fail. 所以我们的研究人员经常在凌晨两点咖啡洒了一地，那时人类大脑已经撑不住了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.24,0:08:34.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,So we train our robot to clean up after us. 因此我们训练机器人来收拾我们的残局。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.57,0:08:41.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,After a while, it doesn't smell very good. 过了一段时间，味道就不太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.50,0:08:45.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's a whole basket of dirty towels. 整个篮子里都是脏毛巾。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.94,0:08:49.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then we also gave the robot a shift at Videsque Cafe. 然后我们还让机器人在 Videsque 咖啡馆轮班工作了一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.94,0:08:53.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here's our researcher expressing approval of the robot's cleaning job. 这是我们的研究人员在肯定机器人打扫工作的表现。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.66,0:08:56.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,So the robot here is carrying two chips. 所以这里的机器人正拿着两个芯片。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.32,0:09:08.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,The GR00T 2 Turbo runs on the Jetson AGX Thor at 80 motion tokens a second, And Sonic runs on Jetson Orin and that's running at 50 Hertz whole body control. GR00T 2 Turbo 在 Jetson AGX Thor 上以每秒 80 个动作 token 的速度运行，Sonic 则在 Jetson Orin 上运行，实现每秒 50 赫兹的全身控制。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:14.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,So here is a party night at our lab and the robot serving popcorns. 这是我们实验室的派对之夜，机器人在分发爆米花。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.51,0:09:21.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,And actually we charge cash and we sell the popcorns. 实际上我们收现金，还卖爆米花。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.83,0:09:26.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,As far as I know, I think that's the only revenue that our team makes for the company. 据我所知，我认为这是我们团队为公司创造的唯一收入来源。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.53,0:09:30.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,So the ARR is about $20 per night. 所以每晚的年经常性收入约为20美元。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.65,0:09:35.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, very diligent, working around the clock, selling popcorn. 是的，非常勤勉，全天候工作，卖爆米花。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.91,0:09:44.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,On our X-Adapt benchmark, GR00T 2 shows much stronger emergent transfer than baselines. 在我们的X-Adapt基准测试中，GR00T 2展现出比基线模型更强的涌现迁移能力。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.18,0:09:49.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,And next, GR00T 2 is more than a single model checkpoint. 接下来，GR00T 2远不止是一个单一模型检查点。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.92,0:09:55.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,We blur the boundary of System 1 and 2 in what we call unified cognition. 我们在所谓的统一认知中模糊了系统1和系统2的界限。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.33,0:09:58.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here's an example instruction. 这是一个示例指令。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.11,0:10:02.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,You saw the trash by recycling and food waste and these complex criterion. 你看到了通过回收和食物垃圾以及这些复杂标准分类的垃圾。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.91,0:10:09.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,and Astra figures out the semantics of the scene and paints the guidance directly onto the pixels. Astra 会理解场景的语义，并直接将引导信息绘制到像素上。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.59,0:10:12.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,So we call this new interface, WAM API. 因此我们称这种新接口为 WAM API。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.07,0:10:16.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And GR00T 2 natively supports this type of visual steering. GR00T 2 原生支持这种视觉引导类型。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.33,0:10:20.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,And in this way, we factor out reasoning from physics. 通过这种方式，我们将推理从物理中分离出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.10,0:10:28.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,And with visual steering, Astra and GR00T 2 can go hand in hand to solve the Tower of Hanoi, Zero Shot. 通过视觉转向，Astra 和 GR00T 2 可以协同完成汉诺塔问题的零样本求解。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.68,0:10:32.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is executing a physical recursion algorithm. 这是在执行一个物理递归算法。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.52,0:10:38.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, it will be completely unnecessary for a two billion model to be able to write a recursive code. 你知道，对于一个拥有二十亿参数的模型来说，能够编写递归代码完全是不必要的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.23,0:10:47.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, WAM API allows GR00T 2 to offload cognition upstream and focus on what it does best. 因此，WAM API 使 GR00T 2 能够将认知任务上移，专注于它最擅长的部分。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.12,0:10:52.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the whole system is able to recover from failure and verify success. 整个系统能够从故障中恢复并验证成功。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.77,0:10:56.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here's a second way to interface that we call WAM Edit. 这是第二种接口方式，我们称之为 WAM 编辑。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.54,0:11:04.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, Astra watches the camera feed, monitors the proprioception, and intervenes on the action execution directly. Astra 会观察摄像头画面，监控本体感觉，并直接干预动作执行。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.76,0:11:11.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,And GR00T 2 still handles the vast majority of the motion, and Astra only applies a delta when necessary. GR00T 2 仍然负责绝大部分运动，Astra 只在必要时施加微调。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.99,0:11:15.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And let me take you back to our chemistry lab. 让我带你们回到我们的化学实验室。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.73,0:11:17.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here's an end-to-end uncut scene. 这是一段端到端的完整未剪辑画面。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.58,0:11:24.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,The task is to take some substance here, put it on a tray, and watch it under the microscope. 任务是取一些物质，放到托盘上，然后在显微镜下观察。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.22,0:11:30.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, for the System 1 model, sometimes it loses track of the repetitive motions, 对于 System 1 模型来说，有时会丢失对重复动作的追踪。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.22,0:11:38.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,and here Astra correctly intervenes on the proprioception and stops the dip at two dips specified by our system prompt. 这里，Astra 正确地干预了本体感觉，并在我们系统提示中指定的两个下垂处停止了动作。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.65,0:11:42.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then we also connect Astra to the microscope view. 然后我们还将 Astra 连接到显微镜视图。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.47,0:11:47.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then it's able to, here, here it comes. 然后它就能在这里，它来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.54,0:11:50.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,It turns on the microscope, Astra is connected to the microscope, 它打开了显微镜，Astra 已连接到显微镜，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.57,0:12:00.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,and it instructs the robot hand to rotate just the right degree of angle so it comes in sharp focus. 并指示机械手旋转到恰好合适的角度，使图像清晰对焦。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.45,0:12:03.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's all real-time and cut autonomous. 全程实时且自主运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.02,0:12:11.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the third way is through an agentic harness we developed in-house called Aspire that combines GR00T 2, 第三种方式是通过我们内部开发的代理式运行框架 Aspire，它结合了 GR00T 2，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.60,0:12:15.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,native GR00T 2, with code-based skills authored by trial and error. 原生的 GR00T 2，以及通过试错编写出的代码技能。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.10,0:12:24.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,And Aspire can switch seamlessly from GR00T 2 to code as policy for error recovery or monitor safety like a guardian angel. Aspire 可以在 GR00T 2 和代码策略之间无缝切换，用于错误恢复或像守护天使一样监控安全。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.50,0:12:26.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here's how it works. 这就是它的运作方式。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.84,0:12:30.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,We first construct a sim environment and have Astra explore with it. 我们首先构建一个仿真环境，并让 Astra 在其中探索。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.70,0:12:37.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can think of it as fine-tuning or priming Astra in code space without gradient descent. 你可以把它看作是在代码空间中对 Astra 进行微调或预训练，而无需梯度下降。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.02,0:12:38.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this is still insane. 所以这仍然令人难以置信。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.36,0:12:42.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we can transfer this type of skills directly to the real world. 我们可以将这类技能直接迁移到现实世界中。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.58,0:12:46.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,And GR00T 2 is part of the skill library. GR00T 2 是技能库的一部分。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.40,0:12:49.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,And here GR00T actually makes a mistake. 这里 GR00T 实际上犯了一个错误。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.72,0:12:53.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,It got the upper side of the wing upside down. 它把机翼的上表面装反了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.02,0:13:02.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,And Aspire executes a recovery poke that actually allows GR00T to resume control and install the upper wing correctly. Aspire 执行了一次恢复性操作，实际上让 GR00T 恢复了控制，并正确安装了上机翼。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.78,0:13:14.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then we can just have a human dump the parts in any ways you want, and it just keeps assembling. 然后我们只需让人把零件随意丢进去，它就会持续组装下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.24,0:13:18.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's so good that it basically turns reality into Minecraft. 它太厉害了，几乎把现实变成了我的世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.35,0:13:30.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,The robot just keeps working through the night and filling our Minecraft inventory day and night at essentially 100 % robustness. 机器人整夜不停工作，日以继夜地填充我们的我的世界库存，几乎实现了 100% 的鲁棒性。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.93,0:13:37.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,So being able to do this before 2027 is beyond my wildest imagination. 能在 2027 年之前做到这一点，已经超出了我最疯狂的想象。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.99,0:13:40.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Neither Astra nor GR00T can do this alone. Astra 和 GR00T 都无法单独完成这件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.29,0:13:42.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you need both. 你必须两者兼备。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.03,0:13:45.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Remember these sad kittens? 还记得这些可怜的小猫吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.34,0:13:49.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Turns out that we're one stage beyond celebration. 结果发现，我们已经超越了庆祝的阶段。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.77,0:13:56.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Astra didn't shatter our dreams, but it shattered our walls. Astra 没有击碎我们的梦想，却击碎了我们的壁垒。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.37,0:14:02.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Frontier LLMs lower the barrier of entry and raise the ceiling for robotics. 前沿大模型降低了机器人技术的入门门槛，同时提升了其上限。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.49,0:14:09.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we as a community just have to admit that robotics is no longer an elitist sport anymore. 作为社区，我们必须承认，机器人技术已不再是精英专属的运动。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.70,0:14:14.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,The mission is too important to leave anybody out. 这项使命太重要了，不能让任何人掉队。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.90,0:14:16.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,So GR00T is opening the gates. 所以 GR00T 正在打开大门。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.77,0:14:24.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm excited to announce that both GR00T 2 and Turbo Weights and a X-Adapt recipe will be open source in December. 我很高兴宣布，GR00T 2 和 Turbo Weights 以及 X-Adapt 食谱都将在十二月开源。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.32,0:14:27.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,You need to own System 1 untethered. 你需要拥有一个不受束缚的 System 1。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.94,0:14:41.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,You need to own System 1 untethered and free of the tyranny of conference wifi. 你需要拥有一个不受束缚的 System 1，摆脱会议场所 Wi-Fi 的束缚。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.91,0:14:45.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we're going more than that. 我们还将走得更远。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.89,0:14:47.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're open sourcing our simulation engine. 我们将开源我们的仿真引擎。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.19,0:14:52.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is Sim Foundry, our real-to-sim pipeline with physical validation. 这是 Sim Foundry，我们的真实世界到仿真环境的流程，并支持物理验证。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.32,0:14:57.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,It supports features like particle physics, articulated objects, and so on. 它支持粒子物理、关节物体等特性。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.53,0:15:01.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,And with Astra, you can easily build sim at scale. 使用 Astra，你可以轻松实现大规模仿真构建。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.64,0:15:07.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sim Foundry 1.0 is available today and 2.0 coming in early 2027. Sim Foundry 1.0 今日可用，2.0 将于 2027 年初发布。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.10,0:15:11.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're open sourcing our agentic harness. 我们将开源我们的代理式运行框架。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.02,0:15:13.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is Aspire, 这是 Aspire，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.06,0:15:21.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,our agent framework that learns a skill library that compounds over time and enables a new type of continual learning without gradient descent. 我们的智能体框架，能够持续学习技能库，随时间积累，并实现无需梯度下降的新一代持续学习。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.30,0:15:25.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're open sourcing our annotation engine. 我们将开源我们的标注引擎。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.80,0:15:30.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is Flora, our open model suite for massive scale data curation. 这是 Flora，我们用于大规模数据整理的开源模型套件。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.96,0:15:36.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,It gives you these accurate curations, captions, auto evolves and reward functions. 它提供精准的数据整理、自动标注、自动演化和奖励函数。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.98,0:15:46.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,And if you host Flora locally, it's 125 times cheaper than Astra at the same performance We're open sourcing our training data. 如果你本地部署 Flora，其成本仅为 Astra 在同等性能下的 1/125。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.98,0:15:54.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,This initiative called Human One Million is our high quality in-house training data. 这项计划名为“人类百万”，是我们高质量的内部训练数据。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.04,0:15:59.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we are open sourcing the first 100,000 hours today. 而且今天我们正在开源前10万小时的训练数据。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.00,0:16:04.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,And last but not least, we're even open sourcing our hardware design. 最后但同样重要的是，我们甚至会开源我们的硬件设计。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.87,0:16:11.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,So for all these devices you saw, the UMI, DexUMI, and the Flexible Neck, now you can build it in your own garage. 所以对于你们刚才看到的所有设备——UMI、DexUMI 和柔性颈部，现在你们可以在自家车库中自己动手搭建。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.17,0:16:12.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're giving you all the blueprints. 我们把所有设计蓝图都提供给你们。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.81,0:16:15.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,So it's really a leap of faith. 这真的是一次信念的飞跃。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.85,0:16:17.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Take as much as you want. 想拿多少就拿多少。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.24,0:16:28.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're building an open ecosystem and sending an open invitation because we would like people from all disciplines, all walks of life, 我们正在构建一个开放的生态系统，并发出开放的邀请，因为我们希望来自各个领域、各种背景的人们，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.88,0:16:33.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,to build robots, to experience physical AGI firsthand, 都能来制造机器人，亲身体验物理 AGI，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.29,0:16:41.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,and to own a piece together in this greatest step function change that humanity has ever seen. 一起参与人类历史上最重大的跃迁式变革。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.41,0:16:49.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,And GR00T has brought to you, with so many sleepless nights and so much love from NVIDIA, Team Green. GR00T 由英伟达绿色团队倾注无数不眠之夜与满满爱意，呈献给您。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.26,0:16:52.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,And one more thing. 还有一件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.47,0:16:57.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'd like to show you a task that is impossible to teleop. 我想向你们展示一个无法通过遥操作完成的任务。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.93,0:17:01.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,That must be run at high inference rate locally. 这必须以高推理速率在本地运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.33,0:17:07.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Autonomous, uncut, 1x speed, real time. 自主、未剪辑、1倍速、实时。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.26,0:17:17.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,And don't worry, we're good friends without fire marshal. 别担心，我们是无火警隐患的好朋友。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.42,0:17:21.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,That right there is the flame of hope. 那就是希望之火。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.96,0:17:30.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,From now on, anyone could become a roboticist and everything that moves will be autonomous. 从现在起，任何人都可以成为机器人专家，所有移动的物体都将实现自主。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:33.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,And in that flame, summer is coming. 在那火焰之中，夏天即将到来。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.64,0:17:35.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thanks. 谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.60,0:17:39.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Jim. 谢谢你，吉姆。
